    "sentence_translations": [
      "Ben’s Diary – Autumn Excursion",
      "",
      "Today, we went for an autumn excursion to Fragrance Hill!",
      "This was my first autumn excursion since coming to China.",
      "",
      "I woke up before 6 in the morning.",
      "The teacher had us come to school at 8. I saw that it was still early, so I slept for while longer.",
      "Who would’ve known, this time I slept until 8 o’clock!",
      "I immediately ran to the school, and luckily I made it.",
      "",
      "We took the bus to Fragrance Hill together.",
      "The autumn leaves in Fragrance Hill were all red.",
      "Seen from a distance, they looked like clusters of fire, and it was especially beautiful.",
      "But there were a lot of people at Fragrance Hill.",
      "I wanted to take a photo of the autumn leaves, but all I could capture was people.",
      ""
    ]
